1
00:00:00,080 --> 00:00:03,433
Ever tried to zip a carry-on after buying too many souvenirs?
买纪念品买多了，你有没有试过硬塞登机箱？

2
00:00:03,553 --> 00:00:07,854
You can rearrange, squeeze, or sit on it. But the suitcase refuses to grow.
你可以重新摆、用力压，甚至坐上去，但箱子就是不会变大。

3
00:00:07,974 --> 00:00:10,300
Floorplanning starts with the same kind of problem.
芯片布局规划，本质上就是同一类问题。

4
00:00:10,840 --> 00:00:12,963
Shrink the suitcase onto a chip.
把登机箱缩小到芯片上。

5
00:00:13,083 --> 00:00:17,824
The fixed chip outline is the bag. The circuit modules are the items.
固定轮廓就是箱子，电路模块就是行李。

6
00:00:17,944 --> 00:00:21,937
After clustering and partitioning, floorplanning decides where each module physically goes.
完成聚类和划分后，布局规划决定每个模块放在哪里。

7
00:00:22,057 --> 00:00:24,100
Same packing rules. Much less space.
规则一样，空间更小。

8
00:00:24,640 --> 00:00:28,210
A legal floorplan must pass two checks.
合法布局必须通过两项检查。

9
00:00:28,330 --> 00:00:31,374
Every module stays inside the outline.
所有模块都必须位于轮廓内。

10
00:00:31,494 --> 00:00:35,591
No pair may have a positive-area interior overlap.
任意两个模块都不能有正面积内部重叠。

11
00:00:35,711 --> 00:00:37,620
Both checks must pass.
两项都通过，布局才合法。

12
00:00:38,160 --> 00:00:42,189
Our teaching instance is ten units wide by eight units tall.
本课实例宽10、高8。

13
00:00:42,309 --> 00:00:48,977
Five modules must fit: A is 3×2, B is 2×3, C and E are 2×2, D is 3×1.
需要放入5个模块：A为3×2，B为2×3，C和E为2×2，D为3×1。

14
00:00:49,097 --> 00:00:51,160
Coordinates start at the lower-left corner.
坐标从左下角开始。

15
00:00:51,700 --> 00:00:53,224
Start with a bad packing.
先看一个错误布局。

16
00:00:53,344 --> 00:00:57,168
E starts at x equals nine, and it is two units wide.
E从x=9开始，宽度为2。

17
00:00:57,288 --> 00:01:00,784
Its right edge reaches eleven, but the outline ends at ten.
它的右边界到11，而轮廓只到10。

18
00:01:00,904 --> 00:01:04,320
The suitcase does not stretch. E is outside, so legality fails.
箱子不会拉伸，E跑到外面，因此合法性失败。

19
00:01:04,860 --> 00:01:07,295
Quick check. Where does E end?
快速检查：E的右边界到哪里？

20
00:01:07,415 --> 00:01:10,275
Ten, eleven, or does it still fit?
是10、11，还是仍然能放进去？

21
00:01:10,395 --> 00:01:12,750
Three. Two. One. Make your choice.
三、二、一，请作答。

22
00:01:14,070 --> 00:01:16,234
The right edge is eleven, not ten.
右边界是11，不是10。

23
00:01:16,354 --> 00:01:18,518
E hangs one unit outside the outline.
E有一格悬在轮廓外。

24
00:01:18,638 --> 00:01:19,823
Answer B: containment failure.
答案是B：包含性失败。

25
00:01:19,943 --> 00:01:22,680
The rest of the layout does not matter yet.
此时其他布局因素都还不重要。

26
00:01:23,220 --> 00:01:26,649
Place a coffee cup on top of a laptop.
把咖啡杯放在笔记本电脑上。

27
00:01:26,769 --> 00:01:31,382
Two objects occupy the same footprint. On a chip, that is illegal.
两件物品占用了同一块位置，这在芯片里是非法的。

28
00:01:31,502 --> 00:01:35,640
Here, E sits on C, so the checker reports an overlap.
这里E压在C上，检查器报告内部重叠。

29
00:01:36,180 --> 00:01:38,434
Think of two books side by side.
想想两本并排的书。

30
00:01:38,554 --> 00:01:41,827
They can touch at their covers without sharing page area.
书皮可以接触，但不会共享页面面积。

31
00:01:41,947 --> 00:01:46,576
Modules may share an edge. The contact has zero area, so it is legal.
模块也可以共享一条边；接触面积为零，所以合法。

32
00:01:46,696 --> 00:01:48,870
Stacking one block on another is not.
但把一个块压在另一个上就不行。

33
00:01:49,410 --> 00:01:50,592
Which packing passes?
哪一种布局合法？

34
00:01:50,712 --> 00:01:57,538
A: E escapes. B: E sits on C. C: C and E sit side by side.
A：E跑出轮廓；B：E压在C上；C：C和E并排接触。

35
00:01:57,658 --> 00:01:58,760
Three. Two. One.
三、二、一。

36
00:02:00,280 --> 00:02:01,636
The answer is C.
答案是C。

37
00:02:01,756 --> 00:02:04,589
Edge contact has zero area, so it passes.
边缘接触面积为零，所以通过。

38
00:02:04,709 --> 00:02:06,803
A fails containment. B fails overlap.
A违反包含性，B违反不重叠规则。

39
00:02:06,923 --> 00:02:11,890
The bag closes only when every block is inside and no interiors are shared.
只有全部模块在内且内部不重叠，箱子才能真正合上。

40
00:02:12,430 --> 00:02:14,148
Here is the golden packing.
这是标准合法布局。

41
00:02:14,268 --> 00:02:20,398
A is at the origin. D is above A. B, C, and E run along the bottom.
A在原点，D在A上方，B、C、E沿底部排列。

42
00:02:20,518 --> 00:02:23,707
Every module is inside 10×8, with no interior overlap.
所有模块都在10×8轮廓内，内部互不重叠。

43
00:02:23,827 --> 00:02:26,200
The suitcase closes, and legality is true.
箱子合上了，合法性为true。

44
00:02:26,740 --> 00:02:31,831
Weighing an open carry-on gives a number, but the bag is not packed.
给还开着的登机箱称重会得到数字，但箱子并没有装好。

45
00:02:31,951 --> 00:02:34,237
Chip metrics work the same way.
芯片指标也是同样道理。

46
00:02:34,357 --> 00:02:39,047
Illegal layouts can produce density or deadspace, but the score means nothing.
非法布局也能算出密度或空白率，但结果没有意义。

47
00:02:39,167 --> 00:02:40,170
Check legality first.
先检查合法性。

48
00:02:40,710 --> 00:02:42,471
ChipBot runs two loops.
ChipBot执行两个循环。

49
00:02:42,591 --> 00:02:45,294
First, check containment for every module.
第一，检查每个模块是否都在轮廓内。

50
00:02:45,414 --> 00:02:49,057
Then check every pair for positive-area interior overlap.
第二，检查每一对模块是否有正面积内部重叠。

51
00:02:49,177 --> 00:02:53,210
One failed check is enough to reject the pack.
任何一项失败，布局都会被拒绝。

52
00:02:53,750 --> 00:02:55,461
ChipBot sees three traps.
ChipBot发现三个陷阱。

53
00:02:55,581 --> 00:02:58,665
Off-by-one boundaries can misclassify a legal edge.
边界差一会把合法情况判错。

54
00:02:58,785 --> 00:03:02,326
A centre coordinate is not a lower-left rectangle.
中心坐标不等同于左下角定义。

55
00:03:02,446 --> 00:03:05,450
Touching is not overlapping. Check the geometry.
接触不等于重叠，要检查几何关系。

56
00:03:05,990 --> 00:03:10,095
C starts at x equals five and is two units wide.
C从x=5开始，宽度为2。

57
00:03:10,215 --> 00:03:13,552
Its right edge is seven. E starts at seven.
C的右边界是7，E正好从7开始。

58
00:03:13,672 --> 00:03:17,778
Do they overlap by two, overlap by one, or only touch?
它们重叠2、重叠1，还是只接触？

59
00:03:17,898 --> 00:03:18,850
Three. Two. One.
三、二、一。

60
00:03:20,370 --> 00:03:21,349
They only touch.
它们只是接触。

61
00:03:21,469 --> 00:03:25,381
C ends where E begins, so the contact has zero area.
C结束的位置正好是E开始的位置，接触面积为零。

62
00:03:25,501 --> 00:03:28,679
The answer is C, and the packing is legal.
答案是C，布局合法。

63
00:03:28,799 --> 00:03:32,630
If E began at six, they would overlap by one unit.
如果E从6开始，它们就会重叠1格。

64
00:03:33,170 --> 00:03:36,149
That is fixed-outline legality.
这就是固定轮廓合法性。

65
00:03:36,269 --> 00:03:41,572
Two rules: everything inside, no interior overlap.
两条规则：全部在轮廓内，内部不重叠。

66
00:03:41,692 --> 00:03:45,446
Fix legality before optimising anything.
先保证合法，再优化其他指标。

67
00:03:45,566 --> 00:03:49,240
Next: area, density, and deadspace.
下一课：面积、密度和空白率。
